mbsystemadministration(8)   System Manager's Manual  mbsystemadministration(8)

NAME
     mbsystemadministration – helper for the Setup Assistant application.

DESCRIPTION
     mbsystemadministration is used by the Setup Assistant application to
     configure system-level settings. It is not meant to be invoked directly.

 macOS 27.0                   November 10, 2016     mbsystemadministration(8)
